    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800411/2018004110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もし行ったら感想教えてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004110050,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ええ\r\n……………………",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800411/2018004110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004110060,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……アニメに漫画、ゲームに映画にドラマに、音楽……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "fade_out",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800411/2018004110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004110070,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……今ってさ、\r\n追っかけきれないくらい面白いものがあって……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "005",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800411/2018004110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004110080,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "しかも、スマホがあれば簡単に見れちゃうじゃない？",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800411/2018004110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに、スマホでドラマとか観ること増えたな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004110090,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "うん、最新のとかも観られるし便利よね",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800411/2018004110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、じわじわ話題になったのも、\r\n後から気軽に観られるからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004110100,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800411/2018004110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004110110,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……それに比べて、アイドルの応援って大変よね\r\n現場まで行かないといけないし、お金もかかるし",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800411/2018004110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004110120,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "あと、グッズが欲しけりゃ朝一番から並んで、\r\nっていうかそもそもチケットも取れなかったりして……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800411/2018004110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004110130,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふゆだって、アニメのイベント、\r\nチケット取れなくてブチ切れたことあるし",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800411/2018004110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018004110140,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "なんなのよほんと\r\nご用意しなさいよ",
